{
  "type": "max232",
  "name": "RS-232 transceiver MAX232",
  "category": "Power & interface",
  "prefix": "U",
  "description": "RS-232 line driver and receiver (MAX232, DIP-16) on 5 V: T1IN/T2IN (TTL) give inverted levels of about +-8.5 V on T1OUT/T2OUT; R1IN/R2IN (RS-232, 5 kohm) give inverted TTL levels on R1OUT/R2OUT. The charge pump is not simulated (its rails are inside), but a real board needs its four 1 uF capacitors on C1+/C1-, C2+/C2-, V+ and V-. Behavioral",
